	abstract = {Assessment and testing are among the biggest challenges for the release of automated driving. Up to this date, the exact procedure to achieve homologation is not settled. Current research focuses on scenario-based approaches that represent driving scenarios as test cases within a scenario space. This avoids redundancies in testing, enables the inclusion of virtual testing into the process, and makes a statement about test coverage possible. However, it is unclear how to deﬁne such a scenario space and the coverage criterion.},
